#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/ovpsim.rst:15
msgid "OVPsim"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/ovpsim.rst:20
msgid ""
"OVPsim is a multiprocessor platform emulator (often called a full-system "
"simulator) used to run unchanged production binaries of the target hardware. "
"It has public APIs allowing users to create their own processor, peripheral "
"and platform models. Various models are available as open source. For more "
"information, see `OVPsim's official website <https://www.ovpworld.org/?"
"utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

